                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                 Configuration                                  
                                                                                
                  punchout can be configured via a TOML file:                   
                                                                                
                   /home/user/.config/punchout/punchout.toml                    
                                                                                
                        Print sample configuration via:                         
                                                                                
                         $ punchout config show-sample                          
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
 punchout   5 / 6    h/← previous   space/l/→ next   esc/q quit                 